## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **`grep` on `check-img-metadata.ts` output** initially returned no `camera_angle`/`sub_area` matches because those fields are absent from IMG metadata.shot_reference — that absence IS the finding (Designer's `camera_intent` doesn't propagate into IMG metadata).
- **`mockSupabaseWithMatch`** inside `episode-reference-designer.test.ts` was scoped to a `describe` block and inaccessible from my new TD-33 temporal-anchor `describe`. Fixed by writing local `mockSupabaseForTemporal` alongside the new tests.
- **`temporalAnchorLookupPerformed=false` for SH01** caused the narrative to fall into «lookup not performed» wording instead of «first shot of episode (no predecessor)». Fixed by setting the flag `true` regardless of whether previousShotId resolved — semantic is «we ran the check», not «we have a candidate».
- **`/tmp/check-loc.ts` failed** with `Cannot find module '@supabase/supabase-js'` because it was outside the webapp's node_modules. Decided not to write a new script — diagnosis was already complete from architectural code reading.

